Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Lub-thawv-ruaj-ntseg tshiab: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault zais: message yuam-sij: key.
>> decrypted := vault qhib-zais: encrypted yuam-sij: key.

Tawm 
sau-ntawv: ['Message:'], kab-tshiab
sau-ntawv: message, kab-tshiab
sau-ntawv: ['Decrypted:'], kab-tshiab
sau-ntawv: decrypted, kab-tshiab.
